  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Stick Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A precision contour stick that defines and visibly lifts, with a buttery texture that effortlessly blends, seamlessly shapes, and sets for 12 hours.<strong><br><br>Coverage:</strong> Medium</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Matte</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Stick</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Cream</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong></p><p>- Tea Rose Extract: Promotes skin suppleness.</p><p>- Suberin Extract: Offers a visibly smoothing and lifting effect.</p><p>- Vitis Vinifera Extract: Promotes skin smoothness.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong><strong><br></strong>-Glide directly onto skin.</p><p>-Light buffing motions are all that's needed to blend with the Dual-Ended Precision Sculpting Brush (sold separately).</p><p>-To build more dramatic shadows, dab brush directly onto stick and press product into skin using tapping motions.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>-Tea Rose Stem Cells: Restores skin suppleness.</p><p>-Suberin Extract: Offers instant micro-smoothing and lifting effect.</p><p><br></p><p>Dimethicone, Synthetic Wax, Caprylyl Methicone, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Silica, Diisostearyl Malate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Zea Mays (Corn) Oil, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Fruit Extract, Rosa Hybrid Flower Extract, Quercus Suber Bark Extract, Squalane, Arnica Montana Flower Extract**, Pseudozyma Epicola/Apricot Kernel Oil/Olive Fruit Oil/Sunflower Seed Oil/Sweet Almond Oil/(Angelica Gigas/Lithospermum Erythrorhizon) Root Extract Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Apricot Kernel Oil/Olive Fruit Oil/Sweet Almond Oil/Sunflower Seed Oil/Licorice Root Extract Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Camellia Sinensis Seed Oil Ferment Extract Filtrate, Pseudozyma Epicola/Sunflower Seed Oil Ferment Extract Filtrate, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Stearalkonium Bentonite, Calcium Sodium Borosilicate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Boron Nitride, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Cetearyl Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Dicalcium Phosphate, Titanium/Titanium Dioxide, CI 77491/77492 (Iron Oxides), CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 77007 (Ultramarines), CI 77510 (Ferric Ammonium Ferrocyanide).</p><p><br></p><p>**Fermented.</p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
